{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24284","headline":"诏授同州刺史病不赴任因咏所怀 · 白居易","name":"诏授同州刺史病不赴任因咏所怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同州慵不去，此意复谁知。\n诚爱俸钱厚，其如身力衰。\n可怜病判案，何似醉吟诗。\n劳逸悬相远，行藏决不疑。\n徒烦人劝谏，只合自寻思。\n白发来无限，青山去有期。\n野心惟怕闹，家口莫愁饥。\n卖却新昌宅，聊充送老资。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24284.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24284","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}